00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:19.829
<v Valdo>Yeah, yeah. Portuguese is very, very simple, because like, the
information is already implicit, because it's in the question,

00:03:19.829 --> 00:03:22.180
<v Valdo>so you don't have to repeat it.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:23.050
<v Orlando><lang pt-BR>Dei</lang>, right?

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:28.550
<v Orlando>And so we're going to do a dialogue, and in that dialogue
